ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ay, no me molestes ahora.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Me pillas en muy mal momento,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡estoy jugando al escondite!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ehi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non distrarmi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Non vedi che sto giocando
a nascondino?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sono concentratissimo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Şimdi benimle konuşma!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Son derece
ciddi bir saklambaç
oyununun ortasındayım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Weg da! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Nicht ansprechen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Wirst du wohl weggehen?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Mann! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Wenn ich jetzt deinetwegen
gefunden werde, dann...
